{
  "note": "T056 phrase set for permitted voice recordings: equal RU/KK business requests. Each key is a list of acceptable spellings (digits or words); keys marked critical carry amounts, quantities, people or a negated action, where a recognition error must lead to a confirmation request (REQ AI 07), not an action.",
  "phrases": [
    {
      "id": "ru-01",
      "locale": "ru",
      "text": "Сколько осталось чёрного чая на основном складе?",
